kg:note_ref6553_scopecontent_0_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdf:value "Son of Fermān Fermā. Visit to Persepolis as Gov.-Gen. of Fārs with distinguished company. Also to Naqsh-i Rajab, Naqsh-i Rustam, Istakhr, Band-i Amīr via Radjiābād (Achaemenian ruins). Comments of Prince Firuz on excavations and preservation of monuments (pp.30--1)" .

kg:note_ref6555_scopecontent_0_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdf:value "Preparation of plan; squeezes of all inscriptions--uneiform, Arabic, Pahlavi and Persian; notes on graffiti, sculptures, ceramics, neighboring ruins. Sketch: plan of terrace (p.47); wing of Ahuramazda symbol with traces of color (p.49)." .

kg:note_ref6557_scopecontent_0_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
