    crm:P2_has_type aat:300027182 ;
    crm:P3_has_note "Scope and Contents note Son of Fermān Fermā. Visit to Persepolis as Gov.-Gen. of Fārs with distinguished company. Also to Naqsh-i Rajab, Naqsh-i Rustam, Istakhr, Band-i Amīr via Radjiābād (Achaemenian ruins). Comments of Prince Firuz on excavations and preservation of monuments (pp.30--1)" ;
