kg:note_ref6531_arrangement_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Arrangement" ;
    crm:P148_has_component kg:note_ref6531_arrangement_0_p_0 ;
    crm:P2_has_type mbs:Arrangement ;
    rdf:value "Arrangement In the original arrangement of the Ernst Herzfeld Archive, Travel Journals were included in a larger body of diverse material acknowledged by Ernst Herzfeld as his study collection. In the early 1970s, Joseph Upton, for research purpose, rearranged the collection and created a specific series (Ernst Herzfeld Papers, Series 1: Travel Journals, 1905-1928) for eight travel journals. For some reason, Upton has given this journal an accession number related to the series he created for the notebooks (Ernst Herzfeld Papers, Series 3: Notebooks, 1904-1946, 1957, n.d.), probably following Herzfeld's original organization." ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:Arrangement .

