    rdf:value "Scope and Contents note Study of tombs and reliefs; squeezes of cuneiform, Greek and Pahlavi inscriptions; notes on Achaemenian city and plan of area. Sketch: sarcophagi in tomb of Darius (p.19). Similarities of ceramics with those of Khurha (p.25)" ;
